    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/80f485ebbf1015567a1590e41878d6be.avif?t=1749589082\" data-has-big width=800 height=73 /></span>Fight, hack, and survive in a world overrun by hostile machines, where each incursion is a race against death. Lia: Hacking Destiny is a fast-paced action roguelite with intense combat and choices that shape your journey toward freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/239e4bf71024157134b171f080130030.poster.avif?t=1749589082\" width=576 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/239e4bf71024157134b171f080130030.webm?t=1749589082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/239e4bf71024157134b171f080130030.mp4?t=1749589082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge attacks, slide along walls, and combine weapons and abilities to crush enemies in adrenaline-filled battles. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique. Security complexes change every time, with procedurally generated rooms, traps, and enemies. Learn, adapt, and push further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Constant Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons, unlock abilities, modify equipment, and personalize your playstyle. From aggressive builds to tactical strategies. The power is in your hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hack the System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use technology to your advantage. Modify alert levels to access secret rooms and uncover hidden secrets behind walls of concrete and steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/c9b7c50a8153d0ea7d63f7689789a5f4.avif?t=1749589082\" data-has-big width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/7a6ded007d5cb06edd72087ac1276daa.poster.avif?t=1749589082\" width=576 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/7a6ded007d5cb06edd72087ac1276daa.webm?t=1749589082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/7a6ded007d5cb06edd72087ac1276daa.mp4?t=1749589082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid combat with responsive controls</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite systems with ever-changing maps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable skills and weapons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base with NPCs and permanent upgrades</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant visual style with a post-apocalyptic atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/0f125f08843eb5b4e2f39d460e6a8cc3.avif?t=1749589082\" data-has-big width=800 height=73 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/ddc8a64209a4bf074349b8be5abec764.poster.avif?t=1749589082\" width=576 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/ddc8a64209a4bf074349b8be5abec764.webm?t=1749589082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/ddc8a64209a4bf074349b8be5abec764.mp4?t=1749589082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/80f485ebbf1015567a1590e41878d6be.avif?t=1749589082\" data-has-big width=800 height=73 /></span>Fight, hack, and survive in a world overrun by hostile machines, where each incursion is a race against death. Lia: Hacking Destiny is a fast-paced action roguelite with intense combat and choices that shape your journey toward freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/239e4bf71024157134b171f080130030.poster.avif?t=1749589082\" width=576 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/239e4bf71024157134b171f080130030.webm?t=1749589082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/239e4bf71024157134b171f080130030.mp4?t=1749589082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge attacks, slide along walls, and combine weapons and abilities to crush enemies in adrenaline-filled battles. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique. Security complexes change every time, with procedurally generated rooms, traps, and enemies. Learn, adapt, and push further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Constant Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons, unlock abilities, modify equipment, and personalize your playstyle. From aggressive builds to tactical strategies. The power is in your hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hack the System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use technology to your advantage. Modify alert levels to access secret rooms and uncover hidden secrets behind walls of concrete and steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/c9b7c50a8153d0ea7d63f7689789a5f4.avif?t=1749589082\" data-has-big width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/7a6ded007d5cb06edd72087ac1276daa.poster.avif?t=1749589082\" width=576 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/7a6ded007d5cb06edd72087ac1276daa.webm?t=1749589082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/7a6ded007d5cb06edd72087ac1276daa.mp4?t=1749589082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid combat with responsive controls</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite systems with ever-changing maps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable skills and weapons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base with NPCs and permanent upgrades</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant visual style with a post-apocalyptic atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/0f125f08843eb5b4e2f39d460e6a8cc3.avif?t=1749589082\" data-has-big width=800 height=73 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/ddc8a64209a4bf074349b8be5abec764.poster.avif?t=1749589082\" width=576 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/ddc8a64209a4bf074349b8be5abec764.webm?t=1749589082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/ddc8a64209a4bf074349b8be5abec764.mp4?t=1749589082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
